  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Vietnam &#x2013; Australia Human Resource Development Program (Aus4Skills)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This investment supports Vietnam to access and use high-level professional and technical knowledge, skills, and competencies to contribute to its sustainable socio-economic development. Its outcomes include: alumni using new skills and knowledge; Vietnamese partners demonstrating organisational change in policies, practices and standards; and, building stronger sustainable links with Australian partners. Aus4Skills has five components: Australia Awards Scholarships, alumni engagement, higher education capacity building, promoting industry linkages with vocational education and training, and supporting Vietnam&#x2019;s future leadership. Aus4Skills also delivers short courses funded by the Mekong Australia Partnership and other regional programs.</narrative>
  </description>
